 translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibilityInputLabels(_:isEnabled:)-pel3":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibilityinputlabels(_:isenabled:)-pel3","type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/accessibilityInputLabels(_:isEnabled:)-pel3","title":"accessibilityInputLabels(_:isEnabled:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accessibilityInputLabels"},{"kind":"text","text":"(["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"LocalizedStringKey","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI18LocalizedStringKeyV"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"isEnabled"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ModifiedContent","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI15ModifiedContentV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI31AccessibilityAttachmentModifierV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AccessibilityAttachmentModifier"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","title":"Interaction_DragView","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"type":"text","text":" patch, which wires its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"output "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Position"},{"type":"text","text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}]}}}